WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.474
Welcome to Orbit. Right now. Our focus is Present Continuous.

2
00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:11.977
Use am, is or are plus the ing form to describe something happening now.

3
00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:14.642
Lily is waiting for the bus now.

4
00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:17.231
Her brother is playing a game.

5
00:00:17.231 --> 00:00:19.930
I am wearing a blue coat today.

6
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:29.328
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
